// Source: https://github.com/mattiapertusati/SPLUNK-SOC-LAB
// Collected: 2026-07-17
// KQL Library - https://github.com/sivolko/kql-library

SecurityEvent
| where EventID in (7045, 4697)
| where EventData has "PSEXESVC" or EventData has "PsExec execution service"
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, Account, EventData